  "content": "\n\n<blockquote>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">qModeling</span> 是一款基于方块的 Minecraft 建模模组。它添加了工作区（Workspace）和工作区钥匙（Workspace Key）物品。</strong></p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>功能特性</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>专用的工作区块块，用于编辑会话。</li>\n<li>打开工作区 UI 需要手持工作区钥匙物品。</li>\n<li>自由摄像机模式，支持流畅的镜头控制。</li>\n<li>变换工具（Gizmo）：移动（X/Y/Z 轴）、旋转（圆环）、缩放（轴向手柄）。</li>\n<li>轴心点编辑模式（<span>T</span>），带有可见的轴心标记和数值输入框。</li>\n<li>变换空间切换：全局/局部（<span>G</span>）。</li>\n<li>部件列表，包含方块图标、选择、复制聚焦、多选以及拖拽至文件夹功能。</li>\n<li>文件夹系统：支持创建、重命名、删除、折叠、颜色标记及按文件夹选择。</li>\n<li>方块替换操作（<span>⇄</span>）。</li>\n<li>编辑模式：\n<ul>\n<li>普通：步进编辑（鼠标旋转自动吸附至 15&deg;）。</li>\n<li>精细：0.02 步进。</li>\n<li>数值：手动输入 XYZ、按轴缩放、轴心字段及单个部件的光照控制。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>沿 X/Y/Z 轴镜像，并正确处理朝向镜像（西/东、南/北、上/下，若属性存在）。</li>\n<li>选中部件的可见性切换（<span>◎/○</span>）。</li>\n<li>单个部件的亮度/光照控制（光照值 0&ndash;15）。</li>\n<li>变换历史记录：撤销/重做（<span>Ctrl+Z</span>&nbsp;/&nbsp;<span>Ctrl+Y</span>）。</li>\n<li>剪贴板复制/粘贴。</li>\n<li>导出为 Yuushya Modeling JSON（<span>Y</span>&nbsp;键）。</li>\n<li>从剪贴板导入 Yuushya JSON。</li>\n<li>基于 HEX 值的 UI 颜色自定义。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>按键控制</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><span>V</span></strong>&nbsp;&mdash;&nbsp;移动</li>\n<li><strong><span>R</span></strong>&nbsp;&mdash;&nbsp;旋转</li>\n<li><strong><span>S</span></strong>&nbsp;&mdash;&nbsp;缩放</li>\n<li><strong><span>T</span>&nbsp;</strong>&mdash;&nbsp;轴心点编辑模式</li>\n<li><strong><span>G</span></strong>&nbsp;&mdash;&nbsp;切换全局/局部坐标</li>\n<li><strong><span>Ctrl+Z</span></strong>&nbsp;&mdash;&nbsp;撤销</li>\n<li><strong><span>Ctrl+Y</span></strong>&nbsp;&mdash;&nbsp;重做</li>\n<li><strong><span>Shift + 鼠标左键点击列表项</span></strong>&nbsp;&mdash;&nbsp;多选</li>\n<li><strong><span>双击列表项</span></strong>&nbsp;&mdash;&nbsp;复制聚焦</li>\n<li><strong><span>X / Y / Z</span></strong>&nbsp;&mdash;&nbsp;沿轴镜像</li>\n</ul>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">qModeling</span><span>&nbsp;&mdash;&nbsp;</span><span>一款</span><span>用于</span><span>方块建模的</span><span>Minecraft</span><span>模组。</span><span>它添加了</span><span>工作区</span><span>与</span><span>工作区钥匙</span><span>物品。</span></strong></p>\n</blockquote>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span>功能特性</span></strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span>专用的</span><span>工作区</span><span>方块，</span><span>用于</span><span>编辑</span><span>会话。</span></li>\n<li><span>打开</span><span>工作区</span><span>界面需手持</span><span>工作区钥匙</span><span>。</span></li>\n<li><span>自由视角模式，</span><span>支持平滑的镜头控制</span><span>。</span></li>\n<li><span>变换工具：</span><span>移动（</span><span>X/</span><span>Y/</span><span>Z 轴）、</span><span>旋转（圆环）、</span><span>缩放（轴向手柄）</span><span>。</span></li>\n<li><span>轴心点编辑（</span><span>T</span><span>），</span><span>带可见标记与数值输入</span><span>。</span></li>\n<li><span>变换空间切换：</span><span>全局/</span><span>局部（</span><span>G</span><span>）。</span></li>\n<li><span>部件列表含</span><span>方块图标、</span><span>选择、</span><span>复制聚焦、</span><span>多选及</span><span>拖拽至文件夹</span><span>。</span></li>\n<li><span>文件夹系统：</span><span>创建、</span><span>重命名、</span><span>删除、</span><span>折叠、</span><span>颜色标记、</span><span>按文件夹选择</span><span>。</span></li>\n<li><span>方块替换（<span>⇄</span>）</span><span>。</span></li>\n<li><span>编辑模式：</span>\n<ul>\n<li><span>普通：</span><span>步进编辑（</span><span>鼠标旋转吸附至</span><span>15&deg;）。</span></li>\n<li><span>精细：</span><span>步长</span><span>0.02</span><span>。</span></li>\n<li><span>数值：</span><span>手动输入</span><span>XYZ、</span><span>按轴缩放、</span><span>轴心字段及</span><span>单部件光照</span><span>。</span></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><span>沿</span><span>X/</span><span>Y/</span><span>Z 镜像，</span><span>正确处理朝向（</span><span>西/</span><span>东、</span><span>南/</span><span>北、</span><span>上/</span><span>下，若存在该属性）。</span></li>\n<li><span>切换选中部件的可见性（</span><span>◎/○</span><span>）。</span></li>\n<li><span>单部件亮度/</span><span>光照控制（</span><span>光照值</span><span>0&ndash;</span><span>15）。</span></li>\n<li><span>变换历史撤销/</span><span>重做（</span><span>Ctrl+Z</span><span>&nbsp;/&nbsp;</span><span>Ctrl+Y</span><span>）。</span></li>\n<li><span>通过剪贴板复制/</span><span>粘贴。</span></li>\n<li><span>导出为 Yuushya Modeling JSON（</span><span>Y 键）。</span></li>\n<li><span>从剪贴板导入 Yuushya JSON。</span></li>\n<li><span>通过 HEX 自定义界面颜色。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span>按键控制</span></strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><span>V</span></strong><span><strong>&nbsp;</strong>&mdash;&nbsp;</span><span>移动</span></li>\n<li><strong><span>R</span></strong><span><strong>&nbsp;</strong>&mdash;&nbsp;</span><span>旋转</span></li>\n<li><strong><span>S</span></strong><span><strong>&nbsp;</strong>&mdash;&nbsp;</span><span>缩放</span></li>\n<li><strong><span>T</span></strong><span><strong>&nbsp;</strong>&mdash;&nbsp;</span><span>轴心点编辑模式</span></li>\n<li><strong><span>G</span></strong><span>&nbsp;&mdash;&nbsp;</span><span>切换全局/局部</span></li>\n<li><strong><span>Ctrl+Z</span></strong><span>&nbsp;&mdash;&nbsp;</span><span>撤销</span></li>\n<li><strong><span>Ctrl+Y</span></strong><span>&nbsp;&mdash;&nbsp;</span><span>重做</span></li>\n<li><strong><span>Shift + 鼠标左键点击列表</span></strong><span>&nbsp;&mdash;&nbsp;</span><span>多选</span></li>\n<li><strong><span>双击列表项</span></strong><span>&nbsp;&mdash;&nbsp;</span><span>复制聚焦</span></li>\n<li><strong><span>X / Y / Z</span></strong><span>&nbsp;&mdash;&nbsp;</span><span>沿轴镜像</span></li>\n</ul>\n</blockquote>",
